Changelog: 18-11-2026 01:11:04

Added. clear() in applog: an app's log file emptied while it stays in use, and the older ones kept beside it
removed. ActionTab: several of them may stand in one row of tabs (PPSSPP Manager's Clear logs beside Start
game); a tab that acts is never the page another one goes back to. InfoButton: opens, a function the app sets to
open a link in the text itself.

Changelog: 17-11-2026 14:53:56

Version 4.2.0.

Changelog: 16-11-2026 00:59:53

Added. ActionPill in widgets: an action as a pill instead of a small button, standing in for a QPushButton (text(),
setText(), setMenu() with its menu under the pill, and click(), which does nothing while the pill is off). Pill
itself is unchanged.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 11:26:39

Version 4.1.0.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 10:20:56

Added. nexus.py gives the development apps their header: header() names the checkout's last commit and its time
(checkout_stamp()) where a released app shows its version (owner, 15-11-2026: the development apps have no
VERSION).
It moves into core from dev/core_compat, which is gone: the development apps import bazzite_console_core.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 10:16:55

Added. exit_keys.py and action_tab.py in core: Escape and a controller's
B close an app's window (install(app), or install(app, controller=False) where the controller is the app's subject),
B only once the app has had the focus for half a second, so the press that closed one app does not close the one
behind it too; ActionTab, a last tab that acts (Start game), which the keyboard passes by. steam.shortcut_number()
gives a shortcut's appid as Steam's file has it. The apps' own copies move onto these.

Fixed. Bluetooth's `from bazzite_console_core import exit_keys` found no module: it is in core now.

Breaking. suite_data(), suite_config(), applog's suite= argument and steam's OPEN_URL, signed_in() and open_url() are
gone: no app or the portal used them.

Added. LICENSE, README.md, pyproject.toml, requirements-dev.txt, .gitignore and tests/ (the shared modules' tests): core
is tested on its own, like every other folder.

